exports[`foedrum: the command line > lists the commands for --help and -h 1`] = `
Usage: foedrum <command> [arguments]

Commands:
  serve                                                   Run the Cellar: brew the Brewery's batches until Ctrl+C
  doctor                                                  Check the tools Foedrum needs and the isolation level
  init [--<question> <answer>]... [--no-input]            Set up a Brewery from a few questions, each answerable by its option, then run doctor
  status [<order>] [--watch]                              List the batches and what each is, or an order's with its planning and brewing tokens
  stuck                                                   List the batches that wait for you, with their questions and what to do next
  brewers                                                 Report each brewer's attempts, outcomes, the batches waiting for you and tokens
  lenses                                                  Report each lens's findings, how they ended, and its tokens
  handover <issue>                                        List what a batch's brewers handed over, each line a proposal a model wrote
  replay <issue>                                          Show a batch's events and its folded state
  resume <issue> [<step>]                                 Open a brewer attempt's Claude Code session in its worktree; take a running batch over
  retry <issue>                                           Try again the step a batch waiting for you stopped at
  skip <issue>                                            Go past the step a batch waiting for you stopped at
  answer <issue> <answers>...                             Answer the questions a batch waits for, one answer each, in order
  approve <issue>                                         Approve the plan a batch waits for you to review; its sub-orders are opened
  lauter <issue> [--as <name>]                            Correct the plan a batch waits for you to review, with the Brewmaster in a session
  recipe <target> <recipe> <reason>                       Brew a batch, or an issue's latest, with another recipe from its first step; an ended issue is ordered again
  rewind <issue> <step> <commits>...                      Take a batch waiting for you back to a step, each repository at its commit
  cancel <issue>                                          Cancel a batch
  pause [<order>] [--by <time>] [--why <reason>] [--all]  Pause an order, or all with --all: nothing new starts; --by stops what runs
  continue [<order>] [--all]                              Lift the pause of an order, or every pause with --all
  stop <order> [--why <reason>]                           Stop an order now: what runs of it is killed, and its batches wait for you until retry
  order <issue>                                           Order an issue, or an ended one again: <alias>#<n> of a target repository, #<n> of the Brewery
  brew <issue> [--as <name>] [--take] [--new-window]      Brew an issue's batch here until it is done or waits for you
  mash <issue> [--as <name>] [--take] [--override]        Ask which recipe brews a Brewery issue, with a suggestion and its reason
  rank <order> [<place>] [--why <reason>]                 Move an order in the intake's queue to place <n>, or mark it to finish first
  takeover <issue> [--as <name>]                          Hand a batch from the driver that holds it to another: --as, else this session, else terminal

init takes:
  [--brewery <owner/name>]
  [--visibility <private|public>]
  [--targets <owner/name ...>]
  [--alias <repo=alias>]...
  [--use-checks <repo=y|n>]...
  [--check <repo:check=command>]...
  [--change <file=y|n>]...
  [--label <repo=y|n>]...
  [--push <y|n>]
  [--shim <n|number>]
  [--repoint <y|n>]

Every command takes --via <plugin|terminal> but serve: the surface its events record.

`;
